specification architecture-curriculum
relation author -> verify label "quyết định" technology "repository"
relation verify -> publish label "bằng chứng" technology "locked-tool"
relation publish -> restore label "khôi phục" technology "repository"
relation adapters_instance -> retail_iceberg label "ingest physical" technology "OpenMetadata"
relation adapters_instance -> retail_duckdb label "ingest logical" technology "OpenMetadata"
deployment private-subnet binds DEP-AWS
boundary trust-data-platform contains publish restore
